Package: backgammonboard
Title: Represent and Render Backgammon Positions
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Marty", "Gale",
    email = "marty.gale@users.noreply.github.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides validated factual backgammon position objects from complete
    eXtreme Gammon identifiers (XGIDs), together with static board rendering
    infrastructure. The package separates factual position state from display
    context and does not evaluate strategy.
